<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109206" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόστεγ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the roof, in the house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				34
			</span></i>: also with Verbs of Motion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβᾶσιν δωμάτων ὑπόστεγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					1386
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσδέδεγμαι πημονὴν ὑπόστεγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					376
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>covered over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					120
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξαμεναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					117b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθέδραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.68
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος ὑ.</span>
			<i>indoor</i> life, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				30.350a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὑ. φιλοσοφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
				</span></i>
			<i>ad Them.</i><i><span class="en">
				262d
			</span></i>.</div>
